Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：世界决斗嘉年华决胜大会！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.05,0:00:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定决斗世界第一的战斗终于要开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从预选中脱颖而出的最强决斗者23名！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！以决斗冠军为目标{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）游马 烟花在响哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天不是决斗嘉年华的决胜大会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要睡到什么时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）来 快起床… 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 不在。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）啊 游马的话为了绝对不迟到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从昨晚开始就住在心园前面了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊……真是的就算再怎么有干劲{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也真是的 这个笨蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～ 游马也真是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗的重要性
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他应该是感受到了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小步）打扫 笨蛋的房间 打扫。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个叫快斗的人 好像也相当帅哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一万多人当中选出来的23个人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会是一场很厉害的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 大家都是超一流的决斗者嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你觉得谁会夺冠？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）为什么 会在这种地方睡得这么死啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 搞什么啊 突然就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，大家这是在干嘛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）还在做梦呢，浦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.53,0:01:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底就是把这儿当成自己家了吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯茜）跟野猫似的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）别迷糊了快醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是心园！今天可是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华决赛的日子！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:02:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对对，对对！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，笨死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀我是怕睡过头才……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果却
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在入口前睡着了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不就白搭了嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，差不多开幕式要开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得赶紧了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了～糟了～糟了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.29,0:02:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站住，你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好大啊！居然在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗吗！太厉害了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）这难道已经
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被施加了某种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对。这是现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此，这也太夸张了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）心之燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在，世界决斗狂欢节的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛大会即将开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一阶段的赛场是园区区域。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，在这个心园
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有地方都能进行决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命名为——决斗过山车！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗过山车？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要坐着过山车进行决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？虽然不太明白{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但好像挺有意思的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊！尽管放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都到这一步了不享受可就亏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）可是游马你不去可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）来吧，从预选中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}脱颖而出的23名决斗者们！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你们的智慧与体力倾尽所有去战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以光荣的首届世界决斗冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}称号为目标！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！这就是决斗过山车吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兴奋起来了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多洛瓦）太得意忘形可是会受重伤的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多洛瓦）决斗过山车可不是闹着玩的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……多洛瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）确实，多洛瓦说得没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这玩意是生死攸关的认真对决。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，好好享受吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人请您务必保重身体……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）轨道，把时间停下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要看清谁持有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可……可是，这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反而会被 No.卡持有者发现……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}0.1秒就够了。快点做。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是……遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果……果然，被发现了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}办完事就赶紧给我消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是……遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～真是不得了的成员都凑齐了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下子，果然得好好享受一番才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些人里面，除了快斗和鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有托隆他们之外
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未知的强敌肯定也混在其中。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越来越有意思了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始兴奋起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（沃尔夫）那就是猎物吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先付这些当定金。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的等活干完再说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……目标是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马这个男人……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）聚集起来了，聚集起来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗啊，把那些 No.卡全部回收吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，马上就要敲响钟声了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勇者们啊，做好战斗的准备吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个过山车会与你们的D视镜连接。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D观镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于，到了为过山车注入生命的时候了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们在预选中收集到的心之碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将成为这座决斗过山车的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}启动钥匙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把心之碎片设置到驾驶舱的指定位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……路线图吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到处都有M和T的标记……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法和陷阱……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。想得挺周到嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有！没有没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到底放哪儿去了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那家伙，真是沉不住气呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太紧张，坏掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种时候那家伙在胡闹什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来不像是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在胡闹的样子呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扫完了打扫完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在笨蛋的房间里找到心啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！心之碎片不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才明里姐联系我了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说是心之碎片在房间里……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她好像正在赶往心园。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐她！？太感谢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马你就待在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家，准备好了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，时候到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}史上最大的战斗之幕现在即将拉开！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经！？完全来不及啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）开始前10秒！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.11,0:11:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}9！8！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}7！6！5！4！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3！2！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～！心之碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1！ Fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）哎呀 只有一台
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马选手的过山车{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出什么故障了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！ 走掉了……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快一点啊 姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}麻烦你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传球！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接住！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～ 来不及了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片。　接住！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞　动了！　上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下　游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么　小鸟也在啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跑起来之前先注意到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下　已经下不去了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抓紧了　小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今　只能两个人一起战斗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是三个人。　我也在。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可是出乎意料的发展！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}起跑时磨蹭了半天的九十九游马选手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}载着女孩子　跑了起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}过山车　本来　是单人乘坐。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　这里就由身为主办者的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我独断专行地批准吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超爽的！　过山车　最棒！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再放慢点速度啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行啊。要是放慢了，不就会被大家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甩得更远了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，这样要怎么决斗啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算想找对手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己能跑的赛道就只有一条啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一条赛道上有两台过山车在跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开 让开 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挡路的家伙，统统撞飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 英雄挑战者 斯巴达斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）对手是 血风暴。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.73,0:14:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 原力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}血风暴的攻击力减半
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:15:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个数值斯巴达克的攻击力 提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 攻击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直线标枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼… 太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这要是 一步 走错难免会受重伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢跑在我前面你还早了 １０年！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要在同一赛道上就能进行决斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还能自由转移赛道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那里遇到的人就打的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）上吧 鲨鱼人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼激流！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦…不愧是鲨鱼啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…游马在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）哼，搞得还挺张扬。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别想逃，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场战斗中，我一定要把你彻底击溃。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）嘿…杂鱼冒出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤机关傀儡·炸弹蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（炸弹蛋）炸弹 炸弹 炸弹…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！上！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:16:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，炸弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杂鱼给我消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子，真是个血气方刚的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来还有多么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漫长的战斗在等着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都还不知道呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在比起战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更应该专注于守住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并增加自己的生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碍事。让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}踢散它吧，维龙·迪西格玛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠近我的人将被地狱的业火包围。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡 奈落之太阳。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2000以上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行直接攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张对方玩家手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然如此 这里是 魔法点。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 被盖放的是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}治疗之神 迪安·凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）真不愧是你 V。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好 鲨鱼也好 都各自发挥出了自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫无保留地发挥出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 他…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 都好厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊… 我也想 快点决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个愿望似乎马上就要实现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看前面。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:18:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 已经拔出来了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏那家伙出慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}省得我从人群中把他引出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（豺狼）剩下的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照委托 把那家伙干掉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（郊狼）大笔钱就到手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错你们想要多少钱 我就给你们多少。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底有多少实力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你让我见识一下就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，首先按计划来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阵型　一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（郊狼／胡狼）收到。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追过来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊？这帮家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们明显是游马，在等着你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从两侧夹击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了不让你逃到旁边的赛道。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很危险啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……甩掉他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前面的T字标记是……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是，埋伏机枪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌和场上的卡每有1张
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成200点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，别这么冷静地解说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赛道的各处
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法和陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来事先设好了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.17,0:20:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么简单的陷阱都没注意到……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的本事也不怎么样嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就赶紧收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把大钱交出来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，小子！跟我们决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！阵型二。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（郊狼／胡狼）收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤磁石·鹰·德尔塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤磁石·术士！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也同样召唤磁石·术士！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.99,0:21:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然召唤出怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还一口气3只……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然就变成3对1的战斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是决斗过山车的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，这是世界决斗狂欢节决赛的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}洗礼吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:22:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，让我见识一下吧九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底有多少实力。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Excalibur是指
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代国王所持有的剑。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.85,0:24:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟本大爷没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.72,0:24:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是本大爷，是国王。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.85,0:24:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是在说人家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.63,0:24:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是大阪。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.95,0:24:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}适可而止吧！

